'''Heartbeat Catcademy''' (トキメキにゃんこ学園, ''Tokimeki Nyanko Gakuen'', '''Tokimeki Nyanko Academy''') is the Spring event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]]. The '''After Story''' and '''Another Confession''' stages were later added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]].

==Event Information==
Can you win the heart of your crush before graduation day?<br>
You're only young once, so get ready to write your own tale of first love with the Cats to support you!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from March 30th (11:00am) until April 27th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Collect tons of Cat Food from the Heartbeat Catcademy Cat Scratcher!'''}}<br>
Win a bonus prize of Cat Food each week from the Cat Scratcher! Just tap one of the three circles and wait for your prize to be revealed!

Make one scratch during each time period listed below!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #1: March 30th (11:00am) until April 5th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #2: April 6th (11:00am) until April 12th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #3: April 13th (11:00am) until April 19th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #4: April 20th (11:00am) until April 27th (10:59am)'''}}

Be sure to claim all four chances for a maximum possible total of {{Color|#FF0000|'''600 Cat Food'''}} in prizes!<br>
Try your luck and get that sweet, sweet Cat Food!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● ON SALE: Beloved leader of the Catcademy, Principal Cat!'''}}<br>
Limited Special unit Principal Cat is on sale, along with a set of items useful for any Cat Army!

Enjoying their special privileges as the head of Heartbeat Catcademy, Principal Cat can be {{Color|#FF0000|'''leveled up immediately with XP'''}}, unlike the other Cats of the event!<br>
Make full use of Principal Cat in limited Heartbeat Catcademy stages like Weekend: Confession where {{Color|#0563C1|'''only certain Cats can be deployed'''}}!<br>
Deploy certain Catcademy allies together to {{Color|#34A853|'''activate special CatCombos'''}}!<br>
No Heartbeat Catcademy stage will be too tough for any Cat Army with Principal Cat leading the charge!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Only one Principal Cat can be purchased per account.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited Heartbeat Catcademy Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Use the event-limited item Love Letters to draw Event Capsules!<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''New unit "Occultist Cat"'''}} has been added to the lineup!<br>
Reward(s): 5 Limited Units, XP, Battle Items, etc.

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Units collected from this Capsule set do not level up using XP.<br>
Collect another of the same character from the Capsules to level it up.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> The + Level maximums for the limited units available during this event are listed below.<br>
・Secret Crush Cat: +55<br>
・Tomboy Lion Cat: +55<br>
・Chalkboard Eraser Cat: +55<br>
・Class Rep Cat: +45<br>
・Occultist Cat: +20<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Event Capsules can only be used with Love Letters acquired during the event.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Event Capsules will be unavailable once the event ends, and any event items collected will no longer be usable.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Leftover event items cannot be exchanged for items or XP.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Heartbeat Catcademy arrives with limited stages!'''}}<br>
Every week, stages that will help you relive the glory days of youthful love will be available!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''All stages have had their rewards reset!'''}}

Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages during this event to test your Cats at Heartbeat Catcademy stages!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Gauntlet Map - "Season 1: School Days"'''}}<br>
Are we becoming... more than friends? Is my life about to change?<br>
Reward(s): Love Letter

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Using a Catamin A will immediately grant another stage attempt.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Heartbeat Catcademy Limited Map: "Season 2: Heartbeat Festival"'''}}<br>
Each week, another limited map will reveal itself in this four-map series filled with youthful dreams of love! The theme of Heartbeat Catcademy Season 2 is... "Heartbeat Festival"!<br>
Reward(s): Love Letter, Battle Items<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from April 6th (11:00am) until April 27th (10:59am)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Check available rewards and point requirements by tapping Timed Score at the bottom left of the map screen!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Heartbeat Catcademy Limited Map: "Season 3: Field Trip"'''}}<br>
The fun never stops in this highly-anticipated event!<br>
Steel your nerves, approach your crush, and you might just earn a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Love Letter'''}} for your troubles!

Reward(s): XP
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from April 13th (11:00am) until April 27th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Heartbeat Academy Limited Map: "Season 4: Graduation Day"'''}}<br>
A selection of stages where only Event Capsule-limited characters {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Secret Crush Cat, Tomboy Lion Cat, Chalkboard Eraser Cat, Class Rep Cat, Occultist Cat, and Principal Cat (Now on sale!)'''}} can be deployed.<br>
The climactic confession! Will the love of your young life accept your declaration of love?!<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, etc.<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from April 20th (11:00am) until April 27th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Heartbeat Catcademy Limited Map: After Story ~Graduation Day~'''}}<br>
A selection of stages where only Event Capsule-limited characters {{Color|#4A86E8|'''Secret Crush Cat, Tomboy Lion Cat, Chalkboard Eraser Cat, Class Rep Cat, Occultist Cat, and Principal Cat (Now on sale!)'''}} can be deployed.<br>
Make long-lasting memories with your pals at the academy for the final time before moving on from life at school!<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, etc.<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from April 20th (11:00am) until April 27th (10:59am)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> These stages can only be played after clearing Season 4: Graduation Day.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Missions and Login Stamps'''}}<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''"Heartbeat Catcademy" Special Missions'''}}<br>
Earn rewards by clearing limited Missions!<br>
Reward(s): Love Letter

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Limited Special Missions are available only until the end of the event. Make sure to accept all rewards before the Missions disappear at the end of the event!<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Collect up to 28 Heartbeat Catcademy Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Reward(s): Love Letter, Rare Ticket, etc.

